      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEFT TILL LAST (1) is on debut without trialling for this. Expected to have ability and can go close in this field. ZIPPING JAKARA (7) filled a minor placing last start at Maitland behind Zipping Nick (23.00) in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Leading chance. MONSTRANCE CLOCK (8) is still a maiden after nine runs but rarely far away, the latest filling a minor placing when second at Gosford. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Expected to feature again. PRINCESS ENERGY (2) is another with top-three prospects.",
